  "$license": "SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 MAINLINE contributors / SPDX-License-Identifier: FSL-1.1-ALv2",
  "$purpose": "The word lists mainline_quarantine.gazetteer.GazetteerAnchorExtractor uses when mainline_domain.anchors is not importable. Layer 4 of ARCHITECTURE.md 8.4 has two real implementations and no stub: an extractor that finds nothing turns every anchor-based refusal into a pass.",
  "$provenance": "DERIVED, verbatim, from the committed ANCHORLOCK gazetteers under verticals/mainline/packages/mainline-domain/src/mainline_domain/data/gazetteer/ at the digests in $source_digests. Copied rather than hand-written so that the two extractors cannot drift by a typo; tests/security/injection/test_corpus.py asserts they agree, class for class and norm for norm, on every corpus document, and fails if a gazetteer edit upstream changes an anchor decision here.",
  "$not_a_claim": "This file does not make the fallback equal to ANCHORLOCK. ANCHORLOCK also carries named-role variants, OCR repair and the drop analysis; the fallback implements the six anchor classes layer 4 checks and nothing else. The classes it does not implement are listed in $unimplemented.",
  "$unimplemented": [
    "named_role"
  ],
